  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li><strong>Công nhân nhà máy A</strong>\n\t\t\t<ul><li>Số trung bình cộng của mẫu số liệu là\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>x</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>47</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\t\tPhương sai của mẫu số liệu là\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>⋯</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>196</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\t\tĐộ lệch chuẩn của mẫu số liệu là\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\t\tSắp xếp lại mẫu số liệu theo thứ tự không giảm, ta được <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>5</mn></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>5</mn></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>5</mn></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>6</mn></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>47</mn></semantics></math>.</li><li>Mốt của mẫu là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>5</mn></semantics></math>.</li><li>Cỡ mẫu là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math> là số chẵn nên giá trị phân vị thứ hai là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br></li><li>Tứ phân vị thứ nhất là trung vị của mẫu <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>5</mn></semantics></math>. Do đó, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.